# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:13
translate italian bais7_c686fa7a:

    # bai "Ugh. High school."
    bai "Uffa. Il liceo."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:14
translate italian bais7_ef3686d1:

    # pc "That bad?"
    pc "Così male?"

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:16
translate italian bais7_4fac01e7:

    # bai "Well, up until senior year it was fine."
    bai "Beh, fino all’ultimo anno andava tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:17
translate italian bais7_604b0453:

    # bai "I was popular. Kind of a jock actually. On the basketball and the baseball team."
    bai "Ero popolare. Anzi, ero una specie di atleta. Giocavo nella squadra di basket e in quella di baseball."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:18
translate italian bais7_33c5c7e8:

    # bai "Everything changed during summer break when I told my girlfriend that I thought I might be interested in guys."
    bai "Tutto è cambiato durante le vacanze estive, quando ho detto alla mia ragazza che pensavo di poter essere attratto dai ragazzi."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:19
translate italian bais7_629195ea:

    # bai "She broke up with me. All my friends stopped talking to me, except when they were calling me names."
    bai "Mi ha lasciato. Tutti i miei amici hanno smesso di parlarmi, tranne quando mi insultavano."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:20
translate italian bais7_07e8b64e:

    # bai "That last year of high school was awful."
    bai "Quell’ultimo anno di liceo è stato orribile."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:21
translate italian bais7_a6d1f112:

    # pc "I'm sorry you had to go through all of that. I thought people were over that homophobic bullshit."
    pc "Mi dispiace che tu abbia dovuto passare tutto questo. Pensavo che la gente avesse superato quelle stronzate omofobe."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:22
translate italian bais7_f4ee3c48:

    # bai "Not in Texas. I'm sure there are assholes everywhere, but it was pretty bad where I lived."
    bai "Non in Texas. Sono sicuro che ci siano stronzi ovunque, ma dove vivevo io la situazione era piuttosto grave."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:24
translate italian bais7_87ae75f0:

    # bai "Anyway, I pretty much stayed by myself that last year. Barely talked to anybody at school. Or at home. It was hard."
    bai "Comunque, quell’ultimo anno sono rimasto praticamente da solo. Parlavo a malapena con qualcuno a scuola. O a casa. È stata dura."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:25
translate italian bais7_1de17344:

    # bai "That's why I wanted to move somewhere far away for college. Somewhere that nobody would know me."
    bai "Ecco perché volevo trasferirmi da qualche parte lontano per l’università. Un posto dove nessuno mi conoscesse."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:26
translate italian bais7_47f7acfb:

    # pc "Well I think the folks here are more accepting."
    pc "Beh, penso che qui la gente sia più tollerante."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:27
translate italian bais7_1cf47993:

    # pc "I definitely am."
    pc "Io lo sono sicuramente."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:28
translate italian bais7_d9d623a9:

    # pc "I hope you'll feel comfortable enough to be yourself. You don't have to hide who you are."
    pc "Spero che tu ti senta abbastanza a tuo agio da poter essere te stesso. Non devi nascondere chi sei."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiConversations/bais7.rpy:30
translate italian bais7_275b8b31:

    # bai "Thanks, man. It feels really good to know that."
    bai "Grazie, amico. È davvero bello saperlo."

